{"words": [{"text": "فَجَعَلْنَـٰهَا", "translation": "So We made it"}, {"text": "نَكَـٰلًۭا", "translation": "a deterrent punishment"}, {"text": "لِّمَا", "translation": "for those"}, {"text": "بَيْنَ", "translation": "(in) front"}, {"text": "يَدَيْهَا", "translation": "(of) them"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "and those"}, {"text": "خَلْفَهَا", "translation": "after them"}, {"text": "وَمَوْعِظَةًۭ", "translation": "and an admonition"}, {"text": "لِّلْمُتَّقِينَ", "translation": "for those who fear (Allah)"}], "sahih": "And We made it a deterrent punishment for those who were present and those who succeeded [them] and a lesson for those who fear Allāh."}